{"seq":1,"slug":"statistical-models","title":"线性与广义线性模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/statistics/statistical-models","wordCount":1324,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"线性与广义线性模型\">线性与广义线性模型</h1><p>R 里拟合一个模型只需要一行 <code>lm(y ~ x1 + x2, data)</code>。这行代码的优雅藏在那个 <code>~</code> 里：它是一个公式对象，把「响应变量由哪些预测变量解释」这件事写成了语言级的结构，而非函数参数的堆砌。从线性回归到逻辑回归到泊松回归，R 用同一套公式接口统一了一大类模型，学会读写公式就掌握了 R 建模的半壁江山。本篇讲清线性模型的数学与诊断、公式语法、以及把响应变量推广到非连续情形的广义线性模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>线性模型与广义线性模型可以用一个统一框架理解：都假设响应的某种「期望」通过一个连接函数与预测变量的线性组合相关。下图展示从普通线性回归到 GLM 的推广关系。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[预测变量线性组合&lt;br/&gt;eta = b0 + b1 x1 + ...] --&gt; B{响应变量类型?}&#10;  B --&gt;|连续, 近正态| C[线性模型 lm&lt;br/&gt;恒等连接]&#10;  B --&gt;|二值 0/1| D[逻辑回归 glm&lt;br/&gt;logit 连接]&#10;  B --&gt;|计数| E[泊松回归 glm&lt;br/&gt;log 连接]&#10;  C --&gt; F[最小二乘估计]&#10;  D --&gt; G[最大似然估计]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; H[系数/诊断/预测]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[预测变量线性组合&lt;br/&gt;eta = b0 + b1 x1 + ...] --&gt; B{响应变量类型?}\n  B --&gt;|连续, 近正态| C[线性模型 lm&lt;br/&gt;恒等连接]\n  B --&gt;|二值 0/1| D[逻辑回归 glm&lt;br/&gt;logit 连接]\n  B --&gt;|计数| E[泊松回归 glm&lt;br/&gt;log 连接]\n  C --&gt; F[最小二乘估计]\n  D --&gt; G[最大似然估计]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; H[系数/诊断/预测]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>下表把这一族模型的关键差异列在一起，它们共享公式接口，区别在响应分布与连接函数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>R 函数</th>\n<th>响应类型</th>\n<th>连接函数</th>\n<th>估计方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性回归</td>\n<td><code>lm</code></td>\n<td>连续</td>\n<td>恒等</td>\n<td>最小二乘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑回归</td>\n<td><code>glm(family=binomial)</code></td>\n<td>二值</td>\n<td>logit</td>\n<td>最大似然</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泊松回归</td>\n<td><code>glm(family=poisson)</code></td>\n<td>计数</td>\n<td>log</td>\n<td>最大似然</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多项/有序</td>\n<td><code>nnet::multinom</code> 等</td>\n<td>多类</td>\n<td>多种</td>\n<td>最大似然</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"线性模型的数学\">线性模型的数学</h2><p>线性回归假设响应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span> 是预测变量的线性组合加上随机误差：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>⋯</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_i = \\beta_0 + \\beta_1 x_{i1} + \\cdots + \\beta_p x_{ip} + \\varepsilon_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，误差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常假设独立、等方差、均值为零。估计系数的方法是最小二乘——选择 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 使残差平方和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i (y_i - \\hat{y}_i)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0497em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 最小。</p>\n<p>这个优化有闭式解。写成矩阵形式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = X\\beta + \\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>β</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>X</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\beta} = (X^\\top X)^{-1} X^\\top y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>。R 内部其实用更数值稳定的 QR 分解而非直接求逆，但概念上就是这个最小二乘解。理解这层代数，能解释为什么共线性（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X^\\top X</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span></span></span></span></span> 接近奇异）会让系数估计变得不稳定。矩阵运算的底层依赖 <a href=\"../foundations/vectors-data-frames\">向量、列表与数据框</a> 中的矩阵结构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"公式接口与-lm\">公式接口与 lm</h2><p>R 的公式 <code>y ~ x1 + x2</code> 是一种领域特定语言，紧凑地表达模型结构。它的符号有特殊含义，与算术运算不同。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"fit &lt;- lm(mpg ~ wt + hp + factor(cyl), data = mtcars)&#10;summary(fit)        # 系数、标准误、t 值、p 值、R²&#10;coef(fit)           # 提取系数&#10;predict(fit, newdata)  # 预测\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fit &#x3C;- lm(mpg ~ wt + hp + factor(cyl), data = mtcars)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>summary(fit)        # 系数、标准误、t 值、p 值、R²</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>coef(fit)           # 提取系数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>predict(fit, newdata)  # 预测</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公式符号</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>y ~ x</code></td>\n<td>y 由 x 解释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>y ~ x1 + x2</code></td>\n<td>多个主效应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>y ~ x1 * x2</code></td>\n<td>主效应 + 交互项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>y ~ x1:x2</code></td>\n<td>仅交互项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>y ~ .</code></td>\n<td>用所有其它列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>y ~ poly(x, 2)</code></td>\n<td>二次多项式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注意因子型预测变量（如 <code>factor(cyl)</code>）会被自动展开成哑变量，每个非基准水平一个系数——这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/vectors-data-frames\">向量、列表与数据框</a> 中强调「分类变量要用因子」的原因。<code>summary()</code> 输出里每个系数的 p 值检验的是「该系数为零」的假设，其推断逻辑详见 <a href=\"hypothesis-inference\">假设检验与统计推断</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模型诊断\">模型诊断</h2><p>拟合出系数只是开始；线性回归的有效性依赖一组假设——线性、误差独立、等方差（同方差）、近似正态。违反这些假设会让标准误和 p 值失真。R 的 <code>plot(fit)</code> 一键给出四张诊断图。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"par(mfrow = c(2, 2))&#10;plot(fit)          # 残差图、QQ图、尺度-位置图、杠杆图\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>par(mfrow = c(2, 2))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plot(fit)          # 残差图、QQ图、尺度-位置图、杠杆图</span></span></code></pre></div><p>四张图各查一项：残差 vs 拟合值查线性与等方差（应无明显模式）；正态 QQ 图查残差正态性（点应贴近对角线）；尺度-位置图查方差是否随拟合值变化；残差 vs 杠杆图找强影响点（Cook 距离大的观测）。诊断不是走过场——一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 很高但残差呈漏斗形的模型，其推断结论可能完全不可靠。当假设严重违反且无法变换修复时，可转向不依赖正态假设的 <a href=\"resampling-bootstrap\">重抽样、自助法与模拟</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"广义线性模型\">广义线性模型</h2><p>当响应变量不是连续近正态——而是二值（是/否）、计数（事件次数）、比例时，线性模型不再合适。广义线性模型（GLM）通过两个推广解决：允许响应服从指数族中的其它分布，并引入连接函数把响应的期望与线性预测子联系起来。</p>\n<p>逻辑回归是最常用的 GLM，用于二分类。它建模的是「成功概率的对数几率」：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\log\\frac{p}{1-p} = \\beta_0 + \\beta_1 x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2286em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7475em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>。logit 连接把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(0,1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的概率映射到整条实轴，使线性建模成立。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 逻辑回归: 预测某事件是否发生&#10;logit_fit &lt;- glm(am ~ wt + hp, data = mtcars, family = binomial)&#10;exp(coef(logit_fit))     # 系数取指数 = 几率比(odds ratio)&#10;predict(logit_fit, type = &quot;response&quot;)   # 预测概率&#10;&#10;# 泊松回归: 建模计数数据&#10;pois_fit &lt;- glm(count ~ treatment + offset(log(exposure)),&#10;                data = df, family = poisson)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 逻辑回归: 预测某事件是否发生</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>logit_fit &#x3C;- glm(am ~ wt + hp, data = mtcars, family = binomial)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>exp(coef(logit_fit))     # 系数取指数 = 几率比(odds ratio)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>predict(logit_fit, type = \"response\")   # 预测概率</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 泊松回归: 建模计数数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pois_fit &#x3C;- glm(count ~ treatment + offset(log(exposure)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                data = df, family = poisson)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>逻辑回归系数取指数后是「几率比」，更易解释：几率比 1.5 意味着该变量每增一单位，事件发生的几率乘以 1.5。GLM 用最大似然估计而非最小二乘，因为非正态响应没有了那个干净的平方和闭式解。GLM 的预测表现评估常借助 <a href=\"resampling-bootstrap\">重抽样、自助法与模拟</a> 中的交叉验证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>线性模型假设响应是预测变量线性组合加正态误差，最小二乘解为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>β</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>X</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\beta} = (X^\\top X)^{-1} X^\\top y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1523em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>（R 内部用 QR 分解）。</li>\n<li>公式 <code>y ~ x</code> 是 R 的建模 DSL：<code>*</code> 含交互、<code>.</code> 用全部列、因子自动展开为哑变量。</li>\n<li><code>summary(fit)</code> 给系数与检验，<code>predict()</code> 做预测；模型诊断用 <code>plot(fit)</code> 查线性、等方差、正态、影响点。</li>\n<li>广义线性模型把响应推广到二值、计数等：逻辑回归用 logit 连接、泊松回归用 log 连接，均用最大似然估计。</li>\n<li>逻辑回归系数取指数得几率比，解释更直观。</li>\n<li>诊断失败可转向 <a href=\"resampling-bootstrap\">重抽样、自助法与模拟</a>；系数检验逻辑见 <a href=\"hypothesis-inference\">假设检验与统计推断</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"线性与广义线性模型","id":"线性与广义线性模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"线性模型的数学","id":"线性模型的数学"},{"level":2,"text":"公式接口与 lm","id":"公式接口与-lm"},{"level":2,"text":"模型诊断","id":"模型诊断"},{"level":2,"text":"广义线性模型","id":"广义线性模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"ggplot2 与图形语法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/tidyverse/ggplot2-visualization"},"next":{"title":"假设检验与统计推断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-statistical-computing/statistics/hypothesis-inference"}}